    "_%n picture or video of your posts could not be copied here._::_%n pictures or videos of your posts could not be copied here._" : ["No at fatu a copiare inoghe %n immàgine o vìdeu de is cummentos tuos.","No at fatu a copiare inoghe %n immàgines o vìdeos de is cummentos tuos."],
    "_%n picture or video of your posts could not be copied here. Your account is pointed at this server without it: the posts that show it lose it, and it is not copied later._::_%n pictures or videos of your posts could not be copied here. Your account is pointed at this server without them: the posts that show them lose them, and they are not copied later._" : ["No at fatu a copiare inoghe %n immàgine o vìdeu de is cummentos tuos. Su contu tuo est puntadu a custu serbidore sena cussu: is cummentos chi ddu mustrant ddu perdent, e non s'at a copiare prus a tardu.","No at fatu a copiare inoghe %n immàgines o vìdeos de is cummentos tuos. Su contu tuo est puntadu a custu serbidore sena cussos: is cummentos chi ddos mustrant ddos perdent, e non s'ant a copiare prus a tardu."],
