    "Move your Bluesky account away" : "Tràmuda su contu tuo de Bluesky",
    "Your Bluesky account can live on another server (a PDS). Your followers, posts and handle history move with it; your Fediverse account here stays as it is. Afterwards this server no longer publishes to Bluesky for you." : "Su contu tuo de Bluesky podet istare in un'àteru serbidore (unu PDS). Is sighidores, is cummentos e sa cronologia de s'identificativu tuo si tràmudant cun issu; su contu tuo de su Fediverse inoghe abarrat comente est. A pustis custu serbidore non pùblicat prus in Bluesky pro tie.",
    "Your Bluesky account now lives on {pds} as {handle}." : "Su contu tuo de Bluesky immoe istat in {pds} comente {handle}.",
    "You, with your recovery phrase, and {host} control it now. This server no longer does." : "Tue, cun sa frase de recùperu tua, e {host} ddu controllades immoe. Custu serbidore non ddu controllat prus.",
    "Only {host} controls it now. This server no longer does." : "Isceti {host} ddu controllat immoe. Custu serbidore non ddu controllat prus.",
    "Your posts did not all arrive on {pds}. Your account still points here." : "Is cummentos tuos non sunt arribados totus a {pds}. Su contu tuo puntat ancora a inoghe.",
