    "Your Bluesky account is moved to {server}. This cannot be undone from here." : "Su contu tuo de Bluesky est tramudadu a {server}. Custu non si podet annullare dae inoghe.",
    "You have no recovery phrase: afterwards only {server} controls your Bluesky account." : "Non tenes una frase de recùperu: a pustis isceti {server} at a controllare su contu tuo de Bluesky.",
    "Move it" : "Tràmuda·ddu",
    "Not now" : "Immoe nono",
    "Move my Bluesky account" : "Tràmuda su contu meu de Bluesky",
    "_{n} picture or video did not arrive on {pds}. Your account still points here._::_{n} pictures or videos did not arrive on {pds}. Your account still points here._" : ["{n} immàgine o vìdeu no est arribadu a {pds}. Su contu tuo puntat ancora a inoghe.","{n} immàgines o vìdeos non sunt arribados a {pds}. Su contu tuo puntat ancora a inoghe."],
    "_{n} picture or video did not arrive on {pds}. Your account is pointed at {pds} without it: the posts that show it lose it there, and it is not copied later._::_{n} pictures or videos did not arrive on {pds}. Your account is pointed at {pds} without them: the posts that show them lose them there, and they are not copied later._" : ["{n} immàgine o vìdeu no est arribadu a {pds}. Su contu tuo est puntadu a {pds} sena cussu: is cummentos chi ddu mustrant ddu perdent inie, e non s'at a copiare prus a tardu.","{n} immàgines o vìdeos non sunt arribados a {pds}. Su contu tuo est puntadu a {pds} sena cussos: is cummentos chi ddos mustrant ddos perdent inie, e non s'ant a copiare prus a tardu."],
    "Following the accounts you follow" : "Sighende is contos chi sighis",
