    "An account you have on Bluesky can live on this server instead. Your followers there keep following you, and your posts and the accounts you follow come along." : "Unu contu chi tenes in Bluesky podet istare in custu serbidore imbetzes. Is sighidores tuos de inie sighint a ti sighire, e is cummentos tuos e is contos chi sighis benint cun tie.",
