    "The Bluesky account you bring replaces {handle}, the one this server made for you: its posts and followers on Bluesky are not kept." : "Su contu de Bluesky chi giughes sostituit {handle}, su chi custu serbidore at creadu pro tie: is cummentos e is sighidores suos in Bluesky no sunt mantentos.",
    "Bring it here" : "Giughe·ddu inoghe",
    "Bring my Bluesky account here" : "Giughe su contu meu de Bluesky inoghe",
    "_%n post you wrote here was taken off Bluesky by the move. It can be published again from your moved account._::_%n posts you wrote here were taken off Bluesky by the move. They can be published again from your moved account._" : ["%n cummentu chi as iscritu inoghe est istadu bogadu dae Bluesky cun su tràmudu. Si podet torrare a publicare dae su contu tuo tramudadu.","%n cummentos chi as iscritu inoghe sunt istados bogados dae Bluesky cun su tràmudu. Si podent torrare a publicare dae su contu tuo tramudadu."],
    "_%n post disappears from Bluesky; you can publish it again afterwards._::_%n posts disappear from Bluesky; you can publish them again afterwards._" : ["%n cummentu isparit dae Bluesky; ddu podes torrare a publicare a pustis.","%n cummentos isparint dae Bluesky; ddos podes torrare a publicare a pustis."],
    "Waiting for Bridgy Fed to start" : "Isetende chi Bridgy Fed cumintzet",
