    "Waiting for your posts" : "Isetende is cummentos tuos",
    "{records} posts arrived, {blobs} pictures and videos so far" : "{records} cummentos arribados, {blobs} immàgines e vìdeos finas a immoe",
    "Could not invite the account" : "No at fatu a invitare su contu",
    "Bring your bridged Bluesky account here" : "Giughe su contu tuo de Bluesky collegadu inoghe",
    "Server" : "Serbidore",
    "Handle" : "Identificativu",
    "E-mail address" : "Indiritzu de posta eletrònica",
    "Password and invite code" : "Crae e còdighe de invitu",
    "The code is shown only now, works once, and only for this account." : "Su còdighe si mustrat isceti immoe, funtzionat una borta ebbia, e isceti pro custu contu.",
    "Bridgy Fed bridges your account to Bluesky as {handle}. That account can live here instead: its followers on Bluesky come along, and Bridgy Fed stops bridging you, since this server reaches Bluesky itself." : "Bridgy Fed collegat su contu tuo a Bluesky comente {handle}. Cussu contu podet istare inoghe imbetzes: is sighidores suos in Bluesky benint cun issu, e Bridgy Fed tzessat de ti collegare, ca custu serbidore lompet a Bluesky a sa sola.",
    "Your account sends Bridgy Fed a direct message asking it to move {twin} here. It replaces {handle}, the Bluesky account this server made for you: that one's posts and followers are not kept." : "Su contu tuo imbiat a Bridgy Fed unu messàgiu diretu pro li pedire de tramudare {twin} inoghe. Sostituit {handle}, su contu de Bluesky chi custu serbidore at creadu pro tie: is cummentos e is sighidores de cussu no sunt mantentos.",
    "Ask Bridgy Fed" : "Pedi a Bridgy Fed",
    "A Bluesky account that Bridgy Fed or a migration tool moves can live on this server. Name it, and the server answers what the tool needs." : "Unu contu de Bluesky chi Bridgy Fed o un'aina de tràmudu tràmudat podet istare in custu serbidore. Nàrali su nùmene, e su serbidore rispondet a su chi s'aina rechedet.",
    "Gave your bridged account a domain of your own as its handle? Bluesky's search is asked for your Fediverse address to find it." : "As dadu a su contu tuo collegadu unu domìniu tuo comente identificativu? Si pedit a sa chirca de Bluesky s'indiritzu tuo de su Fediverse pro dd'agatare.",
    "No account bridged by Bridgy Fed names your Fediverse account." : "Perunu contu collegadu dae Bridgy Fed nòmenat su contu tuo de su Fediverse.",
    "Look for my bridged account on Bluesky" : "Chirca su contu meu collegadu in Bluesky",
    "Another account, with a migration tool" : "Un'àteru contu, cun un'aina de tràmudu",
    "The Bluesky handle or DID to move here" : "S'identificativu o DID de Bluesky de tramudare inoghe",
    "The account you move here replaces {handle}, the Bluesky account this server made for you: that one's posts and followers are not kept." : "Su contu chi tràmudas inoghe sostituit {handle}, su contu de Bluesky chi custu serbidore at creadu pro tie: is cummentos e is sighidores de cussu no sunt mantentos.",
    "Invite it" : "Invita·ddu",
    "Invite the account" : "Invita su contu",
