    "I have written them down" : "Los apo iscritos",
    "Could not read your Bluesky identity right now." : "In custu momentu no at fatu a lèghere s'identidade tua de Bluesky.",
    "The directory that keeps Bluesky identifiers could not be asked right now." : "In custu momentu no at fatu a interrogare su diretòriu chi mantenet is identificadores de Bluesky.",
