    "Could not read your app passwords right now." : "In custu momentu no at fatu a lèghere is craes de aplicatzione tuas.",
    "Could not make an app password with that name" : "No at fatu a creare una crae de aplicatzione cun cussu nùmene",
    "Could not make an app password" : "No at fatu a creare una crae de aplicatzione",
    "Could not revoke that app password" : "No at fatu a revocare cussa crae de aplicatzione",
    "Could not read your signed-in apps right now." : "In custu momentu no at fatu a lèghere is aplicatziones in ue ses intradu.",
    "Post, like, follow and read as you" : "Publicare, pònnere m'agradat, sighire e lèghere comente a tie",
    "Know who you are" : "Ischire chie ses",
    "Could not sign the app out" : "No at fatu a disconnètere s'aplicatzione",
    "Could not change whether your blocks are published" : "No at fatu a cambiare si is blocos tuos sunt publicados",
    "Could not switch your presence on Bluesky" : "No at fatu a cambiare sa presèntzia tua in Bluesky",
    "Copy the Bluesky handle" : "Còpia s'identificativu de Bluesky",
    "DID" : "DID",
    "Copy the DID" : "Còpia su DID",
    "Your Bluesky identity is not registered with the directory yet; this server keeps trying. Your profile and posts go to Bluesky once it is." : "S'identidade Bluesky tua no est galu registrada in su diretòriu; custu serbidore sighit a proare. Su profilu e is cummentos tuos andant a Bluesky cando at a èssere registrada.",
    "Be on Bluesky" : "Èssere in Bluesky",
    "You are not on Bluesky: your profile and posts are not shown there, and nothing new goes there. Bluesky apps are signed out of your account, and your Bluesky messages and notifications are not read." : "Non ses in Bluesky: su profilu e is cummentos tuos non bi sunt mustrados, e nudda de nou bi lompet. Is aplicatziones de Bluesky sunt essidas de su contu tuo, e is messàgios e is notìficas tuas de Bluesky non sunt lèghidos.",
    "You can still follow and read Bluesky accounts here, but your likes, replies and messages to them stay here. Switched back on, your handle, profile and earlier posts are back; posts written while off stay off Bluesky." : "Podes ancora sighire e lèghere contos de Bluesky inoghe, ma is m'agradat, is rispostas e is messàgios tuos a issos abarrant inoghe. Torrende a ativare, s'identificativu, su profilu e is cummentos tuos de prima torrant; is cummentos iscritos cando fiat disativadu abarrant foras de Bluesky.",
    "Switched off, your Bluesky profile and posts are no longer shown there and nothing new goes there. Your handle stays yours, and switching back on brings everything back except what you wrote while off." : "Disativadu, su profilu e is cummentos tuos de Bluesky non bi sunt prus mustrados e nudda de nou bi lompet. S'identificativu abarrat tuo, e torrende a ativare torrat totu francu su chi as iscritu cando fiat disativadu.",
    "Publish my blocks of Bluesky accounts" : "Pùblica is blocos meos de contos de Bluesky",
    "Bluesky keeps the accounts you block from replying to you, quoting or mentioning you there. Bluesky blocks are public: anybody can see whom you blocked." : "Bluesky impedit a is contos chi blocas de ti rispòndere, de ti tzitare o de ti mentovare inie. Is blocos de Bluesky sunt pùblicos: totus podent bìdere a chie as blocadu.",
    "Your blocks stay on this server: you do not see those accounts here, but on Bluesky they can still reply to you, quote or mention you. Publishing them stops that, and makes them public, as all Bluesky blocks are." : "Is blocos tuos abarrant in custu serbidore: non bides cussos contos inoghe, ma in Bluesky ti podent galu rispòndere, tzitare o mentovare. Publichende·ddos custu si firmat, e diventant pùblicos, comente totu is blocos de Bluesky.",
    "Create a new recovery phrase" : "Crea una frase de recùperu noa",
    "Create recovery phrase" : "Crea frase de recùperu",
    "The phrase you have stops working the moment a new one is made." : "Sa frase chi tenes tzessat de funtzionare deretu cando nde faghes una noa.",
    "Twelve words that prove this Bluesky identity is yours even without this server. They are shown once, for you to write down." : "Dòighi faeddos chi mustrant chi custa identidade de Bluesky est sa tua fintzas sena custu serbidore. Si mustrant una borta ebbia, pro chi ddos iscrias.",
    "Other Bluesky tools do not read the words themselves: the recovery tool below does, and when they are made you also see the key they stand for, written the way tools such as goat take it. This server's key ranks above it, so for 72 hours the server can undo a change made with the phrase, a move to another server included." : "Is àteras ainas de Bluesky non lèghent is faeddos issas etotu: s'aina de recùperu de suta ddu faghet, e cando sunt creados bides fintzas sa crae chi rapresentant, iscrita comente dda leant ainas che a goat. Sa crae de custu serbidore est prus in artu, duncas pro 72 oras su serbidore podet annullare unu cambiamentu fatu cun sa frase, fintzas unu tràmudu a un'àteru serbidore.",
    "Download the recovery tool" : "Iscàrriga s'aina de recùperu",
    "One page that moves your Bluesky identifier to another server with your twelve words, in your browser, even when this server is gone. Keep it with your words." : "Una pàgina ebbia chi tràmudat s'identificadore tuo de Bluesky a un'àteru serbidore cun is dòighi faeddos tuos, in su navigadore tuo, fintzas cando custu serbidore no esistit prus. Mantene·dda cun is faeddos tuos.",
    "Open it here" : "Aberi·dda inoghe",
    "Who controls your Bluesky identifier" : "Chie controllat s'identificadore tuo de Bluesky",
    "These keys can change where your identifier points, the first one ranking highest:" : "Custas craes podent cambiare a ue puntat s'identificadore tuo, sa prima est sa prus arta:",
    "Download your Bluesky account" : "Iscàrriga su contu tuo de Bluesky",
    "Your posts, pictures and the history of your Bluesky identifier, in the files Bluesky tools read, with a guide to moving the account even if this server is gone. The archive from the Migration page holds the same files." : "Is cummentos, is immàgines e sa cronologia de s'identificadore tuo de Bluesky, in is archìvios chi lèghent is ainas de Bluesky, cun una ghia pro tramudare su contu fintzas si custu serbidore no esistit prus. S'archìviu de sa pàgina Tràmudu cuntenet is matessi archìvios.",
    "Open Migration" : "Aberi Tràmudu",
    "Your own domain as your handle" : "Su domìniu tuo comente identificativu",
    "If you own a domain, it can be your Bluesky handle. Your followers stay with you; {assigned} keeps working too." : "Si tenes unu domìniu, podet èssere s'identificativu tuo de Bluesky. Is sighidores tuos abarrant cun tie; fintzas {assigned} sighit a funtzionare.",
    "Your handle is {handle}." : "S'identificativu tuo est {handle}.",
    "{handle} no longer names your account. Bluesky shows it as invalid until the DNS record or file is back." : "{handle} non nòmenat prus su contu tuo. Bluesky ddu mustrat comente non vàlidu finas a cando su registru DNS o s'archìviu no torrant.",
    "Bluesky shows {assigned} as your handle again." : "Bluesky mustrat torra {assigned} comente identificativu tuo.",
    "Use it again" : "Torra·ddu a impreare",
