    "Sign out" : "Essi",
    "These twelve words are shown once and never again. Write them down and keep them where only you can find them." : "Custos dòighi faeddos si mustrant una borta e mai prus. Iscrie·ddos e mantene·ddos in ue isceti tue ddos podes agatare.",
    "Keep the twelve words: they are the whole key. Below is the same key written the way other Bluesky tools take it, for when you use one of them." : "Mantene is dòighi faeddos: sunt sa crae intrea. Inoghe in bassu b'est sa matessi crae iscrita comente dda leant is àteras ainas de Bluesky, pro cando nde impreas una.",
    "Leave Bluesky?" : "Bogare·ti dae Bluesky?",
    "Every Bluesky app signed in to your account is signed out, and your profile and posts are no longer shown on Bluesky. Posts you write while you are off never reach Bluesky, not even after you switch back on." : "Totu is aplicatziones de Bluesky intradas in su contu tuo sunt disconnètidas, e su profilu e is cummentos tuos non si mustrant prus in Bluesky. Is cummentos chi iscries mentras ses disativadu non lompent mai a Bluesky, nemmancu a pustis chi torras a ativare.",
