    "Hidden: no likes, dislikes, boosts or replies are counted for you — on your posts, on anybody else's, and in your phone apps — and other people's profiles show no follower number. Who liked a post is still there to look at, and so is your own follower count." : "Cuadu: perunu m'agradat, no m'agradat, potentziamentu o risposta benit contadu pro tie — in is cummentos tuos, in cussos de is àteros e in is aplicatziones de su telèfonu — e is profilos de is àteras persones no ammustrant su nùmeru de sighidores. Chie at postu m'agradat a unu cummentu si podet galu bìdere, e fintzas su nùmeru de is sighidores tuos.",
