    "_%n view_::_%n views_" : ["%n visualizatzione","%n visualizatziones"],
    "Could not delete your account" : "No at fatu a cantzellare su contu tuo",
    "Everything you posted from here is deleted, your followers and the people you follow are let go, and every server that knew this account is told it is gone. It cannot be undone, and there is no way to get any of it back afterwards — take an archive from the Export button above first if you might want one." : "Totu su chi as publicadu dae inoghe est cantzelladu, is sighidores tuos e is persones chi sighis sunt lassados, e a cada serbidore chi connoschiat custu contu si narat chi no b'est prus. Non si podet annullare, e non b'at manera de nde recuperare nudda a pustis — piga prima un'archìviu dae su butone Esporta inoghe in subra si nde podes àere bisòngiu.",
    "Your account on this server was made for Aloha Social, so it is deleted too, and you are signed out. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go." : "Su contu tuo in custu serbidore est istadu creadu pro Aloha Social, duncas est cantzelladu fintzas cussu, e ses disconnètidu. S'identificativu chi ses cantzellende est riservadu pro un'ora pro chi nemos àteru ddu potzat pigare deretu cando ddu lassas.",
    "Your Nextcloud account is not touched: you stay signed in to everything else, and you can make a new Aloha Social account straight away. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go, so a new account needs a different one." : "Su contu tuo de Nextcloud no est tocadu: abarras intradu in totu su restu, e podes creare unu contu nou de Aloha Social deretu. S'identificativu chi ses cantzellende est riservadu pro un'ora pro chi nemos àteru ddu potzat pigare deretu cando ddu lassas, duncas unu contu nou nde depet tènnere unu diferente.",
    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Unu cummentu chi est giai lòmpidu a su serbidore de àtere est cantzelladu pedende a cussu serbidore de ddu cantzellare. Cuasi totus ddu faghent; a perunu si ddu podet obligare.",
    "Delete my Aloha Social account" : "Cantzella su contu meu de Aloha Social",
    "Type {handle} to confirm that this is the account you mean." : "Iscrie {handle} pro cunfirmare chi est custu su contu chi intendes.",
    "The handle of the account to delete" : "S'identificativu de su contu de cantzellare",
