    "Nothing posted with it yet" : "Ancora nudda publicadu cun custu",
    "Could not load the hashtags you feature" : "No at fatu a carrigare is hashtag tuos in evidèntzia",
    "#{tag} is now featured on your profile" : "#{tag} immoe est in evidèntzia in su profilu tuo",
    "Could not feature that hashtag" : "No at fatu a pònnere in evidèntzia cussu hashtag",
