    "About For you" : "Pro ite est Pro tie",
    "Aloha Social now learns which hashtags interest you from how you read, to build your For you feed. This stays on this server and is only visible to you." : "Aloha Social immoe imparat cales hashtag t'interessant dae comente leghes, pro costruire su flussu Pro tie. Custu abarrat in custu serbidore e est visìbile isceti a tie.",
    "Manage" : "Gesti",
