    "Could not reset your interests" : "No at fatu a torrare a impostare is interessos tuos",
    "Learn from my browsing" : "Impara dae sa navigatzione mea",
    "Which hashtags you linger on, open, like and skip. It stays on this server and nobody but you sees it." : "In cales hashtag ti firmas, cales aberis, agradas e brincas. Abarrat in custu serbidore e nemos ddu bidet francu tue.",
    "Pause learning" : "Pone in pàusa s'imparu",
    "For a day of reading something unusual. For you keeps working with what it knows, and nothing new is learned or forgotten until you switch this back." : "Pro una die in ue leghes calicuna cosa de diferente. Pro tie sighit a funtzionare cun su chi ischit, e nudda de nou est imparadu o ismentigadu finas a cando no torras a ativare custu.",
    "Learning is off, so this list is frozen and For you is hidden. You can still change it, and it is all here when you turn learning back on." : "S'imparu est istudadu, duncas custa lista est blocada e Pro tie est cuadu. Dda podes galu cambiare, e at a èssere totu inoghe cando torras a allùghere s'imparu.",
    "Still learning what you like. Until it knows more, For you also shows hashtags you follow and what is trending here." : "Galu semus imparende ite t'agradat. Finas a cando no ischit de prus, Pro tie mustrat fintzas is hashtag chi sighis e su chi est de tendèntzia inoghe.",
