    "Add to your interests" : "Agiunghe a is interessos tuos",
    "Known hashtags" : "Hashtag connotos",
    "Hashtags you have been reading that are not quite interests yet. Add one to keep it." : "Hashtag chi as lèghidu chi no sunt ancora pròpiu interessos. Agiunghe·nde unu pro ddu mantènnere.",
    "Add #{tag} to your interests" : "Agiunghe #{tag} a is interessos tuos",
    "Languages in For you" : "Lìnguas in Pro tie",
    "All languages" : "Totu is lìnguas",
    "Only posts in these languages. None chosen means every language." : "Isceti cummentos in custas lìnguas. Si non nde seberas peruna, totu is lìnguas.",
    "Forgets everything learned, and the hashtags you added, placed and pinned. Hashtags you follow stay followed." : "Ismentigat totu su chi at imparadu, e is hashtag chi as agiuntu, postu in òrdine e apicadu. Is hashtag chi sighis abarrant sighidos.",
    "Reset all interests?" : "Torrare a impostare totu is interessos?",
    "Everything Aloha Social has learned about what you like goes, with the hashtags you added and the order you gave them. It starts learning again from nothing. This cannot be undone." : "Totu su chi Aloha Social at imparadu de su chi t'agradat si nde andat, cun is hashtag chi as agiuntu e s'òrdine chi ddis as dadu. Torrat a imparare dae nudda. Custu non si podet annullare.",
