    "Tick a list to put them in it. Lists your Nextcloud groups give you are not here: the group decides who is in those." : "Sinna una lista pro ddos pònnere in cussa. Is listas chi ti dant is grupos tuos de Nextcloud no sunt inoghe: est su grupu chi detzidet chie bi est.",
