    "Hold for review" : "Firma pro revisione",
    "Held people can still write to you. Their posts, likes and follows wait in Activities until you look; they do not ring, push or mail." : "Is persones firmadas ti podent galu iscrìere. Is cummentos, is m'agradat e is sighiduras issoro isetant in Atividades finas a cando no castias; non sonant, non imbiant notìficas push e non mandant posta.",
    "An app set this to discard; choosing here replaces it" : "Un'aplicatzione at impostadu custu a iscartare; seberende inoghe ddu sostituis",
