    "Until this is on, the page is a draft only you can see. Once it is on, anybody with the link can read it without signing in — which is the point of it." : "Finas a cando custu no est ativu, sa pàgina est un'abbotzu chi isceti tue podes bìdere. Cando est ativu, chie si siat cun su ligòngiu dda podet lèghere sena intrare — chi est pròpiu su fine suo.",
