    "For the people who follow you, gone after a day. Record a video, upload one, or post a picture or a few words." : "Pro is persones chi ti sighint, isparessit a pustis de una die. Registra unu vìdeu, nde càrriga unu, o pùblica un'immàgine o unos cantos faeddos.",
    "A video, watched full height, one after another. Upload one, drop one here, or record one now." : "Unu vìdeu, castiadu a artària intrea, unu a pustis de s'àteru. Nde càrriga unu, nde lassa cadere unu inoghe, o nde registra unu immoe.",
