    "On: a single key likes, boosts or opens the post you moved to with j or k." : "Ativadu: una tecla ebbia ponet m'agradat, potèntziat o aberit su cummentu a ue ti ses mòvidu cun j o k.",
    "Off: keys do nothing here except what your browser does with them." : "Disativadu: is teclas non faghent nudda inoghe francu su chi ddas faghet fàghere su navigadore tuo.",
    "Keyboard shortcuts are turned off for all of Nextcloud in your Accessibility settings, so they stay off here whatever this switch says." : "Is curtzadòrgios de tecladu sunt disativados pro totu Nextcloud in is cunfiguratziones de Atzessibilidade tuas, duncas abarrant disativados inoghe cale si siat sa positzione de custu interruttore.",
