    "Every account on this server can also be a Bluesky account: the same person, the same posts, reachable as username.{host} from any Bluesky app. Every public post written here is also published there; nothing else is. Switching this on makes this server a Bluesky data server, which is what the requirements beside the switch are about." : "Cada contu in custu serbidore podet èssere fintzas unu contu de Bluesky: sa matessi persone, is matessi cummentos, cuntatàbile comente nùmeneutente.{host} dae cale si siat aplicatzione de Bluesky. Cada cummentu pùblicu iscritu inoghe est publicadu fintzas inie; nudda àteru. Ativende custu, custu serbidore diventat unu serbidore de datos de Bluesky, chi est su chi pertocat is rechisitos a costadu de s'interrutore.",
