    "Jetstream" : "Jetstream",
    "Optional. With occ social:atproto:listen running, a Jetstream endpoint brings posts from followed Bluesky accounts within seconds instead of on the next poll." : "Optzionale. Cun occ social:atproto:listen in esecutzione, un'endpoint Jetstream giughet is cummentos de is contos de Bluesky sighidos in pagos segundos imbetzes de a sa interrogatzione imbeniente.",
    "Bluesky's chat service, where direct messages with people on Bluesky are kept: they arrive in Messages here, and a Bluesky app signed in here with an app password that allows them reaches them too. Empty turns direct messages with Bluesky off." : "Su servìtziu de chat de Bluesky, in ue sunt cunservados is messàgios diretos cun is persones in Bluesky: lompent a Messàgios inoghe, e un'aplicatzione de Bluesky intrada inoghe cun una crae de aplicatzione chi ddos permitit ddos podet lòmpere puru. Bòidu, disativat is messàgios diretos cun Bluesky.",
    "Sync ceiling" : "Lìmite de sincronizatzione",
    "How many AppView requests one polling pass may make. Every followed Bluesky account is asked for new posts in turn; the ceiling bounds what a pass costs." : "Cantas rechestas a s'AppView podet fàghere una passada de interrogatzione. A cada contu de Bluesky sighidu si pedint is cummentos noos a tretu; su lìmite fissat cantu costat una passada.",
    "Trusted Bluesky apps" : "Aplicatziones de Bluesky fidadas",
