    "The registration is deleted and the person is emailed. You can tell them why." : "Sa registratzione est cantzellada e a sa persone si mandat unu messàgiu de posta. Ddi podes nàrrere pro ite.",
    "Could not save the settings" : "No at fatu a sarvare is cunfiguratziones",
    "Could not change who may open Aloha Social" : "No at fatu a cambiare chie podet abèrrere Aloha Social",
    "Could not change the two-factor setting" : "No at fatu a cambiare s'impostatzione de s'autenticatzione in duos passos",
    "They sign in on the normal login page and can use Aloha Social and nothing else: no Files, no Talk, and nobody outside Aloha Social can find them." : "Intrant in sa pàgina de atzessu normale e podent impreare Aloha Social e nudda àteru: nen Archìvios, nen Talk, e nemos a foras de Aloha Social ddos podet agatare.",
    "Aloha Social is limited to some groups, and external users are not in them, so they could register and then not open Aloha Social." : "Aloha Social est limitadu a unos cantos grupos, e is utentes esternos no bi sunt, duncas si diant pòdere registrare e posca no abèrrere Aloha Social.",
    "Let external users open Aloha Social" : "Permite a is utentes esternos de abèrrere Aloha Social",
