    "Only people with an invitation link" : "Isceti is persones cun unu ligòngiu de invitu",
    "An invitation link admits its holder whichever you choose, without approval." : "Unu ligòngiu de invitu faghet intrare chie ddu tenet, cale si siat su sèberu tuo, sena aprovatzione.",
    "Confirm the email address before the account is made" : "Cunfirma s'indiritzu de posta eletrònica in antis de creare su contu",
    "Let everybody here send invitation links" : "Permite a totu is de inoghe de imbiare ligòngios de invitu",
    "Usernames nobody may register, one per line" : "Nùmenes de utente chi nemos podet registrare, unu pro riga",
    "Additional registration and privacy information" : "Informatziones additzionales de registratzione e de riservadesa",
    "Shown before people enter their details. Plain text only; adapt this information to your instance. It is not legal advice. When acceptance is required, changing this text creates a new notice version." : "Mustradas in antis chi is persones insertent is datos issoro. Isceti testu sèmplitze; adata custas informatziones a s'istàntzia tua. No est unu cussìgiu legale. Cando s'atzetatzione est rechesta, cambiende custu testu si creat una versione noa de s'avisu.",
    "Require registrants to accept this notice" : "Rechede chi chie si registrat atzetet custu avisu",
    "The accepted notice version and time are kept with the account until the account is deleted. This records acceptance; it does not make the notice legally sufficient." : "Sa versione de s'avisu atzetada e s'ora sunt mantentas cun su contu finas a cando su contu no est cantzelladu. Custu registrat s'atzetatzione; no faghet s'avisu bàlidu in manera legale.",
    "Require two-factor authentication" : "Rechede s'autenticatzione in duos passos",
    "This server requires two-factor authentication of everybody. Switching this off exempts external users." : "Custu serbidore rechedet s'autenticatzione in duos passos a totus. Istudende custu, is utentes esternos nde sunt esentados.",
    "External users then set up an authenticator app or a security key when they first log in. This is Nextcloud's own setting, the same as in Administration → Security." : "Is utentes esternos tando cunfigurant un'aplicatzione de autenticatzione o una crae de seguresa sa prima borta chi intrant. Est un'impostatzione de Nextcloud matessi, sa matessi de Amministratzione → Seguresa.",
