    "Once the reason is fixed, \"occ social:queue:retry --instance HOST\" puts them back in the queue." : "Cando su motivu est acontzadu, \"occ social:queue:retry --instance HOST\" ddas torrat a pònnere in coa.",
    "_%n delivery waiting to be sent._::_%n deliveries waiting to be sent._" : ["%n cunsigna in isetu de èssere imbiada.","%n cunsignas in isetu de èssere imbiadas."],
    "_%n is being sent right now._::_%n are being sent right now._" : ["%n est imbiende·si in custu momentu.","%n sunt imbiende·si in custu momentu."],
    "_%n delivery has failed at least once._::_%n deliveries have failed at least once._" : ["%n cunsigna est faddida a su mancu una borta.","%n cunsignas sunt faddidas a su mancu una borta."],
    "_%n of them is close to being given up on._::_%n of them are close to being given up on._" : ["%n de issas est acanta de èssere abbandonada.","%n de issas sunt acanta de èssere abbandonadas."],
    "_Nothing has been given up on in the last %n day._::_Nothing has been given up on in the last %n days._" : ["Nudda est istadu abbandonadu in s'ùrtima %n die.","Nudda est istadu abbandonadu in is ùrtimas %n dies."],
    "_%n delivery was given up on: that server never got it._::_%n deliveries were given up on: those servers never got them._" : ["%n cunsigna est istada abbandonada: cussu serbidore no dd'at mai retzida.","%n cunsignas sunt istadas abbandonadas: cussos serbidores no ddas ant mai retzidas."],
    "_Counted over the last %n day, which is how long a finished delivery is kept._::_Counted over the last %n days, which is how long a finished delivery is kept._" : ["Contadas in s'ùrtima %n die, chi est su tempus pro su cale una cunsigna acabbada est mantenta.","Contadas in is ùrtimas %n dies, chi est su tempus pro su cale una cunsigna acabbada est mantenta."],
    "Half-life (days)" : "Mesu-vida (dies)",
    "How fast an interest fades when it is no longer read. After this many days a score is worth half." : "Cantu lestru un'interessu si nde andat cando no est prus lèghidu. A pustis de custas dies unu puntègiu bàlet sa metade.",
    "Listing threshold" : "Lìmite pro s'elencu",
    "The score a learned hashtag needs before it counts as an interest. Lower learns faster and guesses more." : "Su puntègiu chi un'hashtag imparadu depet tènnere in antis de contare comente interessu. Prus bassu imparat prus a lestru e indovinat de prus.",
    "Interests per person" : "Interessos pro persone",
    "The most hashtags one person's list holds." : "Su nùmeru màssimu de hashtag chi sa lista de una persone podet cuntènnere.",
    "Feed window (days)" : "Ventana de su flussu (dies)",
    "How far back the feed looks for posts. Longer finds more for rare interests and costs more to rank." : "Cantu in segus su flussu chircat cummentos. Prus longa agatat de prus pro is interessos raros e costat de prus pro ddos classificare.",
    "A whole number from {min} to {max}" : "Unu nùmeru intreu dae {min} a {max}",
    "A number from {min} to {max}" : "Unu nùmeru dae {min} a {max}",
    "Could not save the For you settings" : "No at fatu a sarvare is cunfiguratziones de Pro tie",
    "Enable For you" : "Ativa Pro tie",
    "Off hides the feed and the settings, and nothing is learned. What was learned is kept, so turning it back on brings everybody's interests back." : "Disativu cuat su flussu e is cunfiguratziones, e nudda est imparadu. Su chi est istadu imparadu est mantentu, duncas torrende·ddu a allùghere torrant is interessos de totus.",
    "Learn from browsing unless a user turns it off" : "Impara dae sa navigatzione francu chi un'utente no dd'istudet",
    "The GDPR-relevant choice: off makes learning opt-in, and each person is invited to turn it on. A user's own choice always wins." : "Su sèberu de importu pro su GDPR: disativu faghet s'imparu a pedidura, e cada persone est invitada a dd'allùghere. Su sèberu de s'utente bincet semper.",
    "Could not load the refused files" : "No at fatu a carrigare is archìvios refudados",
    "Could not refuse that file" : "No at fatu a refudare cuss'archìviu",
    "Could not allow that file again" : "No at fatu a permìtere torra cuss'archìviu",
    "Checksum (sha256)" : "Checksum (sha256)",
    "Why, for whoever reads this next year" : "Pro ite, pro chie at a lèghere custu s'annu chi benit",
    "Refuse this file" : "Refuda custu archìviu",
    "The checksum of a file is what sha256sum prints for it. It matches that exact file: a re-encoded or re-cropped copy is a different file and is not caught." : "Su checksum de un'archìviu est su chi sha256sum imprentat pro issu. Currispondet a cuss'archìviu esatu: una còpia torrada a codificare o retagiada est un'àteru archìviu e no est pigada.",
    "Nothing is refused." : "Nudda est refudadu.",
