    "Allow again" : "Permite torra",
    "_Showing the newest {shown} of {total} refused file._::_Showing the newest {shown} of {total} refused files._" : ["Ammustrende su prus nou {shown} de {total} archìviu refudadu.","Ammustrende is {shown} prus noos de {total} archìvios refudados."],
    "Refused" : "Refudadu",
    "Waiting for an answer" : "In isetu de una risposta",
    "Could not load the relays" : "No at fatu a carrigare is relè",
    "The relay has been asked" : "Su relè est istadu pedidu",
    "Could not subscribe to that relay" : "No at fatu a s'iscrìere a cussu relè",
    "Could not unsubscribe from that relay" : "No at fatu a annullare s'iscritzione a cussu relè",
    "What is shared is public posts and nothing else: a followers-only post has an audience that was chosen, and a relay is the opposite of a chosen audience. Nothing a person on this server writes privately ever reaches one." : "Su chi si cumpartzit sunt is cummentos pùblicos e nudda àteru: unu cummentu isceti pro is sighidores tenet unu pùblicu seberadu, e unu relè est su contràriu de unu pùblicu seberadu. Nudda de su chi una persone de custu serbidore iscriet in privadu nche lompet mai a unu relè.",
    "The relay's address" : "S'indiritzu de su relè",
    "Relays publish this address on their own front page; it usually ends in /actor or /inbox." : "Is relè pùblicant custu indiritzu in sa pàgina printzipale issoro; de sòlitu acabbat cun /actor o /inbox.",
    "This server is not subscribed to any relay." : "Custu serbidore no est iscritu a perunu relè.",
