    "Could not change the retention period" : "No at fatu a cambiare su perìodu de cunservatzione",
    "Keep posts from other servers for (days)" : "Mantene is cummentos de àteros serbidores pro (dies)",
    "Kept anyway: direct messages, posts somebody here liked, boosted, bookmarked or replied under, and posts by people somebody here follows. Posts written here are never deleted." : "Mantentos su matessi: messàgios diretos, cummentos chi a calicunu de inoghe ant agradadu, chi at potentziadu, agiuntu a is sinnalibros o in ue at rispostu, e cummentos de persones chi calicunu de inoghe sighit. Is cummentos iscritos inoghe non sunt mai cantzellados.",
    "The post is deleted and its author is told. This cannot be undone: nothing of it is kept here afterwards." : "Su cummentu est cantzelladu e a s'autore suo si ddu narat. Custu non si podet annullare: nudda de issu est mantentu inoghe a pustis.",
