    "Be kind to the people you are talking to." : "Sias gentile cun is persones cun is cales faeddas.",
    "No harassment, and no encouraging it." : "Perunu fastìgiu, e peruna ispinta a ddu fàghere.",
    "Could not load the rules" : "No at fatu a carrigare is règulas",
    "The rules were saved" : "Is règulas sunt istadas sarvadas",
    "Could not save the rules" : "No at fatu a sarvare is règulas",
    "Every app shows them to somebody deciding whether to join, and other servers read them from this server's public description." : "Cada aplicatzione ddas mustrat a chie est detzidende si s'iscrìere, e is àteros serbidores ddas leghent dae sa descritzione pùblica de custu serbidore.",
    "One rule per line" : "Una règula pro riga",
    "Could not save what this instance offers" : "No at fatu a sarvare su chi custa istàntzia oferit",
    "24-hour shorts" : "Shorts de 24 oras",
    "A video, a picture or a text card for followers, gone after 24 hours. Off means the Shorts bar goes from the home timeline, New short offers only keeping it on the profile, and nothing new is taken." : "Unu vìdeu, un'immàgine o una carta de testu pro is sighidores, chi isparessit a pustis de 24 oras. Disativu bolet nàrrere chi sa barra de is Shorts si nde andat dae sa lìnia temporale printzipale, Short nou oferit isceti de ddu mantènnere in su profilu, e nudda de nou est atzetadu.",
    "Two timelines in the sidebar, each the same posts read through one filter. A post is not changed by its section being off." : "Duas lìnias temporales in sa barra laterale, cada una cun is matessi cummentos lèghidos tràmite unu filtru. Unu cummentu no est cambiadu si sa setzione sua est disativada.",
    "Nextcloud groups that become lists" : "Grupos de Nextcloud chi diventant listas",
    "No groups" : "Perunu grupu",
    "This server has no groups" : "Custu serbidore non tenet grupos",
    "Everybody in one of these groups gets a list for it, holding the members who have an Aloha Social account. Nobody is followed by it and nothing leaves this server: a list is a view, not a relationship. Empty — the default — means no group becomes a list, because a group list tells everybody in the group who else is in it." : "Totus is chi sunt in unu de custos grupos retzint una lista pro cussu grupu, cun is membros chi tenent unu contu de Aloha Social. Nemos benit sighidu dae issa e nudda essit dae custu serbidore: una lista est una vista, no una relatzione. Bòidu — su predefinidu — bolet nàrrere chi perunu grupu diventat una lista, ca una lista de grupu narat a totus is de su grupu chie b'est in prus.",
    "Shown like anything else" : "Mustradu comente cale si siat àtera cosa",
