    "Publish and delete 24-hour shorts as you" : "Publicare e cantzellare shorts de 24 oras comente a tie",
    "The authorization code will be shown to you, to copy into the application yourself." : "Su còdighe de autorizatzione t'at a èssere mustradu, pro ddu copiare tue in s'aplicatzione.",
    "The authorization code will be sent to {target}." : "Su còdighe de autorizatzione at a èssere imbiadu a {target}.",
    "Authorized" : "Autorizadu",
    "Paste this code into {appDisplayName} to finish signing in. It can be used once, and only by the application that asked for it." : "Incolla custu còdighe in {appDisplayName} pro agabbare s'atzessu. Si podet impreare una borta, e isceti dae s'aplicatzione chi dd'at pedidu.",
    "Authorization code" : "Còdighe de autorizatzione",
    "Copy code" : "Còpia su còdighe",
    "Set up your account" : "Cunfigura su contu tuo",
    "{appDisplayName} wants to sign in to your account here, and you do not have one yet. Choose your username first; then you decide whether to let {appDisplayName} in." : "{appDisplayName} bolet intrare in su contu tuo de inoghe, e tue no nde tenes ancora unu. In antis sèbera su nùmene de utente tuo; a pustis decides si lassare intrare {appDisplayName}.",
    "Your account is ready. Taking you on to {appDisplayName}…" : "Su contu tuo est prontu. Ti semus giughende a {appDisplayName}…",
    "Authorization required" : "Autorizatzione rechesta",
    "An app this server's administrator vouches for, by this address." : "Un'aplicatzione garantida dae s'amministratzione de custu serbidore, pro custu indiritzu.",
    "This address is what the app is known by; its name is not checked." : "Custu indiritzu est cun su cale s'aplicatzione est connota; su nùmene suo no est controlladu.",
    "{appDisplayName} would like permission to access your account. It is a third party application." : "{appDisplayName} diat bòlere su permissu de atzèdere a su contu tuo. Est un'aplicatzione de tertzos.",
    "If you do not trust it, then you should not authorize it." : "Si no ti nde fidas, non dda depes autorizare.",
    "This application will be able to:" : "Custa aplicatzione at a pòdere:",
    "Deny" : "Nega",
    "Authorize" : "Autoriza",
    "Follow on Aloha Social" : "Sighi in Nextcloud Sotziale",
    "Hello" : "Oe",
    "Please confirm that you want to follow this account:" : "Cunfirma chi disìgias sighire custu contu:",
    "You are following this account" : "Ses sighende custu contu",
    "You are going to follow:" : "Ses pro sighire:",
    "Your account, as name@domain" : "Su contu tuo, comente nùmene@domìniu",
    "name@domain of your federation account" : "nùmene@domìniu de su contu tuo federadu",
    "Continue" : "Sighi",
    "Could not find your server from that address. Check the name@domain and try again." : "No at fatu a agatare su serbidore tuo dae cuss'indiritzu. Controlla su nùmene@domìniu e torra a proare.",
    "This step is needed as the user is probably not registered on the same server as you are. We will redirect you to your homeserver to follow this account." : "Custu passàgiu est netzessàriu ca s'utente mancari non est registradu in su matessi serbidore tuo. T'amus a torrare a deretare a su homeserver pro sighire custu contu.",
    "There is no such place." : "Non b'at unu logu aici.",
    "The place could not be loaded." : "No at fatu a carrigare su logu.",
    "The posts from this place could not be loaded" : "No at fatu a carrigare is cummentos de custu logu",
    "Public posts that were taken here, as their posters said. A place is never worked out from a picture — it is only ever what somebody chose to say." : "Cummentos pùblicos fatos inoghe, segundu chie ddos at publicados. Unu logu no est mai dedùidu dae un'immàgine — est semper isceti su chi calicunu at seberadu de nàrrere.",
    "Nothing public from here yet" : "Ancora nudda de pùblicu dae inoghe",
    "No portfolio here" : "Perunu portfòliu inoghe",
    "This account has not published one." : "Custu contu non nd'at publicadu unu.",
    "Nothing on it yet" : "Ancora nudda in subra",
    "The pictures this page shows are chosen in Settings." : "Is immàgines chi custa pàgina mustrat si seberant in Cunfiguratziones.",
    "This account is not known here yet. Look it up to see it and follow it." : "Custu contu no est ancora connotu inoghe. Chirca·ddu pro ddu bìdere e ddu sighire.",
    "Looking up…" : "Chirchende…",
    "User not found" : "Utente no agatadu",
    "Sorry, we could not find the account of {userId}" : "Perdona, no at fatu a agatare su contu de {userId}",
