    "No collections yet" : "Ancora peruna colletzione",
    "Gather some of your posts into an album: name one above, then add posts to it from their menu." : "Agrupa unos cantos cummentos tuos in un'àlbum: dàe·nde su nùmene a unu inoghe in subra, e posca agiunghe·bi cummentos dae su menù issoro.",
    "Albums this account makes out of its posts will show up here." : "Is àlbums chi custu contu faghet cun is cummentos suos ant a aparire inoghe.",
    "The followers could not be loaded." : "No at fatu a carrigare is sighidores.",
