    "_%n reply is not shown here. It may be from an account you blocked or muted, or from a server this one has not heard from._::_%n replies are not shown here. They may be from accounts you blocked or muted, or from servers this one has not heard from._" : ["%n risposta no est mustrada inoghe. Podet èssere dae unu contu chi as blocadu o silentziadu, o dae unu serbidore chi custu no at intesu.","%n rispostas no sunt mustradas inoghe. Podent èssere dae contos chi as blocadu o silentziadu, o dae serbidores chi custu no at intesu."],
