    "These figures are for the fediverse only. {networks} publishes no count of its accounts that could be quoted here, so it is not included." : "Custos nùmeros sunt isceti pro su fediverse. {networks} non pùblicat perunu nùmeru de is contos suos chi si potzat tzitare inoghe, duncas no est incluidu.",
    "Translated by {provider}" : "Tradùidu dae {provider}",
    "One step is left, on your old server: tell it to move your followers here. On Mastodon that is Preferences → Account → Move to a different account; enter {handle} there." : "Abarrat unu passàgiu, in su serbidore betzu tuo: nàrali de tramudare is sighidores tuos inoghe. In Mastodon est Preferèntzias → Contu → Tràmuda a unu contu diferente; inserta inie {handle}.",
    "The latest change was made on {date}. Until {until}, it can still be undone by: {keys}." : "S'ùrtimu cambiamentu est istadu fatu su {date}. Finas a su {until}, si podet galu annullare dae: {keys}.",
    "Visible for all" : "Visìbile pro totus",
    "Visible for all, but opted-out of discovery features" : "Visìbile pro totus, ma a foras de is funtzionalidades de iscoberta",
