    "Suspending deletes every post this account has here and refuses anything it sends afterwards. Lifting the suspension later will not bring the posts back." : "Sa suspensione cantzellat totu is cummentos chi custu contu tenet inoghe e refudat totu su chi imbiat a pustis. Bogende sa suspensione prus a tardu is cummentos non torrant.",
